OL,3,GNEWSATrio jailed for abusing vulnerable
OL,4,Agirl in 2000s
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed for sexually
OL,7,Fabusing a girl who was living in a
OL,8,Fchildren's home in Bradford more than
OL,9,F20 years ago.
OL,11,FThe men are among 12 now serving prison
OL,12,Fsentences for offences against the
OL,13,Fgirl, who was repeatedly raped and
OL,14,Fabused in the early 2000s when she was
OL,15,Faged between 13 and 15.
OL,17,FAt Bradford Crown Court, 47-year-old
OL,18,FMohammed Baig was jailed for 21 years,
OL,19,Fwhile Mohammed Suleman, 45, and Sohail
OL,20,FHussain, 40 were jailed for eight and
OL,21,Ffour-and-a-half years respectively.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
